                                "sense_id": "7fb8f13e-d735-33e1-83cf-dd3f9d19da13",
                                "text": "Fruitings can consist of several thousand individual sporocarps."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6dc61d9b-00ce-3b00-8658-03f6af907c14",
                        "entry_id": "c56640a4-198d-3329-a89a-3bcc8d6eceba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of producing fruit, seeds, or spores; fructification."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6803de0-3021-4553-96f1-6695fe68d06b",
                                "sense_id": "6dc61d9b-00ce-3b00-8658-03f6af907c14",
                                "text": "From these figures it will be seen that the fruiting period of cotton in the blacklands of Texas is relatively short, and a majority of the bolls are set early in the season."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "86222243-e530-47f0-8446-56599d24bcbc",
                                "sense_id": "6dc61d9b-00ce-3b00-8658-03f6af907c14",
                                "text": "These factors differ from mushroom to mushroom. Most of the changes that stimulate fruiting have a negative effect on the vegetative growth of the mycelium."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7ca5f527-8507-3757-97a5-24ea9a3946fc",
                        "entry_id": "c56640a4-198d-3329-a89a-3bcc8d6eceba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The occurrence of FRUIT (false replies unsynchronized/uncorrelated in time)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "88c92f4b-c1f9-4ea4-9aaa-b1de97bc1515",
                                "sense_id": "7ca5f527-8507-3757-97a5-24ea9a3946fc",
                                "text": "How many breakdowns or serious impairments of function (quality of return, fruiting, degradation, etc.) did your radar and communications equipment have today?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c5647b4-da88-4fb4-88cc-6ede9efbc324",
                                "sense_id": "7ca5f527-8507-3757-97a5-24ea9a3946fc",
                                "text": "In this way, the problems of fruiting, garbling and over-interrogation are overcome."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
